	(text "Motor supply (VM), 12-24 V nominal, up to 6 A for all four cards:\nJ1 VM_IN -> Q1 (reverse-polarity blocking FET, driven by U2 B_GATE; Q2 is its fast pull-down) -> U2 TPS26630 eFuse -> VM.\nU2 is off while the bus E-stop is low, and while it is unwired: R6/R7 hold SHDN below 0.8 V unless ESTOP_BUS is high.\nUVLO: on at 9.6 V, off at 8.9 V (R3/R4; the DRV8825 needs 8.2 V). OVP: internal, 34.3 V. Current limit: 6 A (R5 3.01k).\nInrush: about 1.1 V/ms (C9 47n). MODE open = latch-off on a fault; cycle the E-stop or power to reset.\nFLT -> GPIO5 (R9 pull-up). IMON -> GPIO28/ADC2: 0.50 V/A into R8 (17.8k), 3.0 V at 6 A.\nD3: 600 W TVS, 33 V standoff, clamps surges below U2's 67 V rating. TI SLVSE94G (TPS2663)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 97.79 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7b7d5819-e3ec-4fb0-a45d-022d3d6b01d6")
	)
